  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The ACCTRANS project aims to accelerate Indonesia&#x2019;s transition toward an inclusive and integrated low-carbon economy by catalyzing climate investment in the land use, land-use change, and forestry (LULUCF) sectors through gender-responsive planning and accessible finance, strengthening Sharia-based climate financing mechanisms, and establishing an integrated industrial emissions reporting platform for hard-to-abate sectors. The project will be implemented in selected regions with significant LUL</narrative>
  </description>
